You see breaking news from the TVs at a storefront. The Strait of something has been bombed for the umpteenth time or something.
Everyone has to do their part. A tax man has come over to collect.
- Do your part and fess up
	The tax man thanks you profusely. He promises you this will be the last time.
	You have no reason to doubt him.
	do Global.change_money(-5)
	Your current money is: {Global.current_money()}
- What? Why? I didn't ask for this!!
	The tax man slaps you and says you are unpatriotic.
	You feel the sting of treachery and shame upon your cheek.
	do Global.change_resolve(-1)
	Your current resolve is: {Global.current_resolve()}